          "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
          "caption": null,
          "media": {
            "alt": {
              "segmentId": "m00124:alt:fig-00008-alt",
              "text": "S N 2 reactions of primary or secondary alcohol with halide, where O H first reacts with S O Cl 2 or P Br 3. The products are alkyl halides."
            },
            "src": "../../media/OChem_11_03_008.jpg",
            "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "id": "para-00017",
